                                                "sense_id": "a001c46b-d6be-33d4-897c-8c30cd603c54",
                                                "text": "Forcible removal of Andrew’s dukedom by an act of parliament could have received government and public support with the king’s backing, but the palace is understood to have hoped Andrew would voluntarily relinquish his title."
